# Video trim, batch 09 of 12: tracing and low-level toolchain.
#
# Vetted list. tools/build-live.sh applies these files in numeric order with:
#
#     apt-get purge -y --auto-remove <the names below>
#
# The order is part of the verification: this working copy was purged with
# these batches in this order, and the video anchors were checked after
# every batch. Do not merge or reorder the files.
#
# gdb, gcc-15-base, gcc-16-base and the cpp chain were candidates and are NOT in this batch: plasma-workspace reaches cpp through x11-xserver-utils, and gcc-16-base is pinned by libgcc-s1. See excludes.list.
#
# 26.10 rebase: the kernel ABI moved 7.0.0-30 -> 7.3.0-9; the two tool
# names follow. The intent is unchanged: tools for the replaced generic kernel go.

bpfcc-tools
bpftool
bpftrace
libbpfcc
python3-bpfcc
linux-perf
linux-tools-7.3.0-9
linux-tools-7.3.0-9-generic
linux-tools-common
trace-cmd
libtraceevent1
libtraceevent1-plugin
libtracefs1
binutils
binutils-common
binutils-x86-64-linux-gnu
libbinutils
make
